version openings
  cite modeller
  known 2022-03-01
  note "Every place opens empty on the model's first day: the claims (no invoice before the business, B-D01; the loan to Bartek is made 2025-02-10, B-D24), the floren account (opened 2025-01-02, B-D23), the mortgage (paid out on the deed's day, B-D07 .1). The accounts' real balances come from the exports' anchors (stated), which re-anchor them; before an account's first anchor its balance is the model's, not the bank's."
  opening[*] = 0 assumed "no balance is known before the first export's anchor; 0 keeps the claims and the debt exact" "modeller"
